### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/administradores

### 1. Login Exitoso (Usuario del Seed)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "federico@mail.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 2. Login con formato de email inválido (Error 400 - Zod)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "correo-no-valido",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3. Login con contraseña vacía (Error 400 - Zod)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "federico@mail.com",
  "password": ""
}

### 4. Login con credenciales incorrectas (Error 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "inexistente@example.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}
